  "title": "NexPoint Hires Oil and Gas Industry Executive to Lead Energy Platform",
  "summary": "Luke Blackwell to Manage Firm’s Oil and Gas Investments as President of NexEnergy DALLAS, June 18, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — NexPoint, a multibillion-dollar alternative investment firm, today announced the hiring of Luke Blackwell to lead the firm’s energy investment platform. Mr. Blackwell will serve as President of NexEnergy, a newly formed group within NexPoint established to support investment activity […]",
